# Implementation Plan — Sprint-004: Human Typing Engine Architecture & Production Implementation

## Overview
Sprint-004 delivers a production-grade, thread-safe, high-performance **Human Typing Engine** for batmanoverlay. The engine simulates realistic human typing characteristics (variable typing speed WPM/CPM, natural jitter, mistake simulation with backspace correction, digraph delays, multi-line & emoji/Unicode support, auto-paste threshold for large texts, pause/resume/cancel semantics, and job queuing) without any platform-specific coupling or UI dependencies.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Browser Module Freeze**: Browser Foundation v1.0 is completely frozen. No changes will be made to `src/browser/` or `src/ui/browser_panel.py`.
