## Proposed Changes

### Module Architecture: `src/typing/`

```
src/typing/
├── __init__.py         # Package exports
├── config.py           # TypingConfig data model (speed, delays, mistake probability, paste threshold, seed)
├── events.py           # TypingSignals Qt signal container & dataclass event payloads
├── interfaces.py       # Protocols (ITypingSimulator, ITypingWorker, ITypingScheduler, ITypingQueue)
├── simulator.py        # Core human typing action generator (digraph timing, mistake generation, grapheme clusters)
├── queue.py            # Thread-safe FIFO/Priority job queue with job cancellation tokens
├── worker.py           # QThread worker executing action steps with microsecond-resolution timing & pause/cancel locks
├── scheduler.py        # Job orchestrator, thread pool manager, and event signal broadcaster
└── engine.py           # Facade API unifying configuration, scheduler, worker lifecycle, and public Qt signals
```

