### [Component Details]

#### [NEW] [config.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/config.py)
- Defines `TypingConfig` (Pydantic model):
  - `speed_wpm: float = 60.0` (Words Per Minute target)
  - `min_delay_ms: float = 20.0`
  - `max_delay_ms: float = 180.0`
  - `initial_delay_ms: float = 300.0`
  - `mistake_probability: float = 0.03` (3% chance of typo)
  - `correction_delay_ms: float = 150.0`
  - `typing_jitter: float = 0.25`
  - `paste_threshold_chars: int = 500` (Switches to paste mode if text length exceeds threshold)
  - `random_seed: int | None = None` (For deterministic test reproducibility)
  - `pause_key: str = "Pause"`
  - `cancel_key: str = "Escape"`

#### [NEW] [events.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/events.py)
- Defines `TypingAction` enum (`TYPE_CHAR`, `BACKSPACE`, `PAUSE`, `PASTE_CHUNK`).
- Defines `TypingStep` data model (char, action_type, delay_ms).
- Defines `TypingSignals(QObject)` emitting Qt signals:
  - `typing_started(str job_id, str text)`
  - `typing_progress(str job_id, int current_index, int total_count, float progress_percent)`
  - `character_typed(str job_id, str char, str action_type)`
  - `paused(str job_id)`
  - `resumed(str job_id)`
  - `cancelled(str job_id)`
  - `completed(str job_id, float duration_seconds)`
  - `error_occurred(str job_id, str error_message)`

#### [NEW] [interfaces.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/interfaces.py)
- Defines Python `@runtime_checkable` protocols:
  - `ITypingSimulator`
  - `ITypingQueue`
  - `ITypingWorker`
  - `ITypingScheduler`

#### [NEW] [simulator.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/simulator.py)
- Core algorithm engine converting raw string into a list of `TypingStep` objects:
  - Grapheme cluster parsing (full support for complex Unicode, multi-code-point emojis like 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦, accent marks, and multi-line `\r\n`).
  - QWERTY key proximity lookup for realistic typo substitution (e.g. typing `t` instead of `r`).
  - Natural mistake workflow: types typo char -> pauses (`correction_delay_ms`) -> types backspace step -> types correct char.
  - Variable Gaussian/Log-normal delay generator respecting WPM/CPM speed, character difficulty, space/punctuation pauses, and jitter bounds.
  - Large text paste mode generation when `len(text) >= paste_threshold_chars`.

#### [NEW] [queue.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/queue.py)
- `TypingJob` data structure (job_id, text, target_widget_id/callback, status, config_override).
- Thread-safe `TypingQueue` using `threading.Lock()` / `queue.PriorityQueue()` supporting push, pop, peek, cancel_job, clear, and list_jobs.

#### [NEW] [worker.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/worker.py)
- `QThread`-based `TypingWorker` driving actual step execution:
  - Uses high-precision `QElapsedTimer` / `time.perf_counter()`.
  - Implements thread-safe Pause/Resume mutex lock (`QWaitCondition` / `threading.Event`).
  - Checks cancellation flag per character step for instantaneous cancellation responsiveness (<5ms).

#### [NEW] [scheduler.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/scheduler.py)
- High-level orchestrator connecting `TypingQueue` to `TypingWorker`.
- Manages job transitions, error handling, worker lifecycle, and signal emission.

#### [NEW] [engine.py](file:///c:/github/batmanoverlay.com/src/typing/engine.py)
- Public Facade API for batmanoverlay:
  - `type_text(text: str, config: TypingConfig | None = None) -> str` (Returns job_id)
  - `pause()` / `resume()` / `cancel(job_id: str | None = None)` / `clear_queue()`
  - Exposed signals accessor `signals: TypingSignals`.

